The Protein Inspector additions -- the inspection-manifest interface,
the annotation layers, the conformation morph, the partner toggle, the export
bundle and the Claude Science skill in claude-science-skill/ -- are released on
the same terms, so that the whole thing stays as free to reuse as the viewer it
is built on.

